// Copy this file to Configuration/Secrets.xcconfig and fill in the real
// values. Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored; this example is committed so a
// fresh clone still generates and builds.
//
// The ingest key is per app and rotatable. It is not a secret in the strong
// sense (it ships inside the binary); it is a spam limiter. The real limits
// are server side: rate limit per install, size caps, insert-only functions.
//
// Note the host has no scheme: "//" starts a comment in an xcconfig file, so
// the app prepends "https://" in code.

BUG_REPORT_INGEST_KEY = replace-me
BUG_REPORT_HOST = replace-me.functions.supabase.co
